1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Stock gifting, made personal.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A thoughtful gift starts with someone you love.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Choose a token, add a note, and share a private link.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
A dedicated test wallet connects to the real Santa app.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Pick AMD. Choose 1 valueless test token.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Your note appears in the gift preview as you type.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Set a 30-day expiry. Check the quantity and personal note.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Real wallet signatures, token approval, and deposit into SantaVault.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:02,000
The real gift is ready. The claim key stays hidden.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The recipient page loads the actual onchain AMD gift.

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,000
This is the real sign-in entry. This recording uses a test-wallet API claim next.

12
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Real API claim with a dedicated test wallet. No sign-in is simulated.

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Confirmed receipt, token delivery, and the decrypted personal note.

14
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Reloading the actual gift now shows that it has been opened.

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:39,000
The explorer confirms success and delivery of 1 AMD test token.

16
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Recipient: 0 to 1 AMD. Santa relayer paid the claim fee.

17
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Testnet tokens have no monetary value or equity ownership rights.
